<title>NORWAY: Maritime Group 8-month profits rise.</title>
<headline>Maritime Group 8-month profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating revenues		 1,454	 vs     1,172</p>
<p>Operating result			59	 vs	  44</p>
<p>Result before tax		     93	 vs	  35</p>
<p>Result after tax			66	 vs	  24</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore supply company is Maritime Group ASA. In September shareholders approved a merger with the Oil and Gas Technology division of Aker ASA. Norway's two main suppliers to the oil industry will merge to form a new company, Aker Maritime ASA. The fusion is expected to be completed by the end of the year.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
